<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has</p>
<p>issued 48 million American-style call and put warrants, in 16</p>
<p>equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS REFER TO ONE INDEX.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	30.APR.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $754.72 (INDICATIVE)</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
